RevOS Insights Page Redesign
Professional Knowledge Discovery Hub with Dynamic Business Challenge-Driven Content Discovery
Production Implementation Specification — V1.0
________________________________________
1. Project Background
I am developing RevOS, an AI-native Revenue Operating System platform.
The existing RevOS website already has a homepage, product pages, CMS, Blog, and Insights functionality.
I now want to redesign the existing public-facing Insights page to create a more sophisticated, professional, and valuable knowledge discovery experience.
The redesigned page should position RevOS Insights as a professional knowledge and intelligence hub for:
•	Go-to-Market Strategy
•	Revenue Operations
•	Sales Performance
•	Lead Qualification
•	Pipeline Management
•	Sales Forecasting
•	Customer Growth
•	AI and Revenue Intelligence
The page should help business leaders, revenue leaders, sales managers, and commercial professionals discover useful knowledge, understand business challenges, and explore practical approaches to improving revenue performance.
Most importantly, the new design must incorporate the RevOS Business Challenge-Driven Content Discovery System.
This system has a centralized Business Challenge taxonomy stored in Supabase and a many-to-many relationship between Business Challenges and Insight articles.
The redesigned Insights page must use this existing system to dynamically organize and present relevant articles according to the business challenges they address.
The objective is to create an experience that goes beyond browsing articles by publication date or topic category.
Visitors should be able to discover relevant knowledge by starting with the business problems they want to solve.
