4. New Insights Page Structure
Build the redesigned Insights page with the following seven sections.
The order and purpose of these sections are important.
Section 1 — Editorial Hero
Objective
Introduce RevOS Insights as a professional knowledge destination for understanding and improving revenue performance.
Suggested headline
Make Better Revenue Decisions.
Supporting description
"Explore practical insights, analytical perspectives, and evidence-driven approaches to the challenges shaping modern revenue performance, sales execution, and business growth."
Suggested visual direction
Create a clean editorial hero with:
•	A small eyebrow label: REVOS INSIGHTS
•	A strong, prominent headline.
•	A concise supporting description.
•	A restrained analytical visual element or abstract data-inspired illustration.
•	An optional navigation action such as Explore Insights.
Avoid a conventional blog banner dominated by a large stock photograph.
The hero should communicate knowledge, clarity, and professional authority.
