Section 2 — Featured Insight
Objective
Highlight one selected or featured Insight article.
The featured article should have stronger visual prominence than ordinary articles.
Data source
Retrieve the featured article from the existing Supabase content system.
Use the existing featured or pinned article field if one exists.
If no such field exists, inspect the current content model and propose the smallest appropriate extension.
Do not introduce unnecessary database changes.
Presentation
Use an editorial feature layout with:
•	Featured image.
•	Article category.
•	Article title.
•	Short excerpt.
•	Publication date.
•	Reading time, if available or reliably calculated.
•	Read Insight link.
The design may use a split layout with text and image side by side.
Ensure the image is responsive and uses appropriate image optimization.
Only show published Insight articles.
If no featured article exists, gracefully use the most recent published Insight article or hide the section according to the agreed product behavior.
